  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2CO 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paul's Vision and His Thorn",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I must go on boasting. Although there is nothing to be gained, I will go on to visions and revelations from the Lord.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I know a man in Christ who fourteen years ago was caught up to the third heaven. Whether it was in the body or out of the body I do not know—God knows.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I know that this man—whether in the body or apart from the body I do not know, but God knows—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "was caught up to paradise and heard inexpressible things, things that no one is permitted to tell.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will boast about a man like that, but I will not boast about myself, except about my weaknesses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even if I should choose to boast, I would not be a fool, because I would be speaking the truth. But I refrain, so no one will think more of me than is warranted by what I do or say,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "or because of these surpassingly great revelations. Therefore, in order to keep me from becoming conceited, I was given a thorn in my flesh, a messenger of Satan, to torment me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Three times I pleaded with the Lord to take it away from me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But he said to me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "wj"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\"My grace is sufficient for you, for my power is made perfect in weakness.\"",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CO.12.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CO.12.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore I will boast all the more gladly about my weaknesses, so that Christ's power may rest on me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That is why, for Christ's sake, I delight in weaknesses, in insults, in hardships, in persecutions, in difficulties. For when I am weak, then I am strong.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Paul's Concern for the Corinthians",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have made a fool of myself, but you drove me to it. I ought to have been commended by you, for I am not in the least inferior to the \"super-apostles,\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "even though I am nothing.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I persevered in demonstrating among you the marks of a true apostle, including signs, wonders and miracles.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "How were you inferior to the other churches, except that I was never a burden to you? Forgive me this wrong!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now I am ready to visit you for the third time, and I will not be a burden to you, because what I want is not your possessions but you. After all, children should not have to save up for their parents, but parents for their children.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I will very gladly spend for you everything I have and expend myself as well. If I love you more, will you love me less?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be that as it may, I have not been a burden to you. Yet, crafty fellow that I am, I caught you by trickery!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Did I exploit you through any of the men I sent to you?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I urged Titus to go to you and I sent our brother with him. Titus did not exploit you, did he? Did we not walk in the same footsteps by the same Spirit?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Have you been thinking all along that we have been defending ourselves to you? We have been speaking in the sight of God as those in Christ; and everything we do, dear friends, is for your strengthening.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For I am afraid that when I come I may not find you as I want you to be, and you may not find me as you want me to be. I fear that there may be discord, jealousy, fits of rage, selfish ambition, slander, gossip, arrogance and disorder.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am afraid that when I come again my God will humble me before you, and I will be grieved over many who have sinned earlier and have not repented of the impurity, sexual sin and debauchery in which they have indulged.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "2CO.13",
    "number": "13",
    "bookId": "2CO"
  },
